CodeAlpha Hangman Game
Description
This project is a text-based Hangman game developed using Python. The player guesses one letter at a time to reveal a hidden word. The game ends when the player guesses the word correctly or reaches the maximum number of incorrect guesses.

Features
Random word selection
Letter-by-letter guessing
Maximum of six incorrect guesses
Input validation
Win and lose conditions
Concepts Used
Random Module
Lists
Strings
While Loop
If-Else Statements
User Input
How to Run
Open the project in Visual Studio Code.
Run Hangman_Game.py.
Enter one letter at a time to guess the hidden word.
Continue until you win or use all six incorrect guesses.
